<section class="bsr-section" id="how">
  <div class="bsr-wrap">
    <div class="bsr-sechead">
      <span class="bsr-pill">★ How It Works</span>
      <h2 class="bsr-display">Four steps to a season<br>on the mountain.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="bsr-steps">
      <div class="bsr-step">
        <span class="bsr-step__num">01</span>
        <h3>Reserve online</h3>
        <p>Pick a package, enter your kid's fitting details, pay for the season in full.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bsr-step">
        <span class="bsr-step__num">02</span>
        <h3>Book the fitting</h3>
        <p>We email you to schedule a fitting appointment at the Beaverton shop.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bsr-step">
        <span class="bsr-step__num">03</span>
        <h3>Ski all winter</h3>
        <p>Gear lives at your house all season. Growth spurt? Bring it in and swap.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bsr-step">
        <span class="bsr-step__num">04</span>
        <h3>Return in spring</h3>
        <p>Drop it back by the season return date. We handle the tune and the storage.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
